\fs32\b Company Career Jobs: Run and Review\b0\fs22\par\par
\b Inputs\b0\par
C:\\Users\\vinod\\Downloads\\company_india_jobs.json\par
C:\\Users\\vinod\\Downloads\\company_india_jobs_flat.json (the grouped and flat sources contain the same 1,233 URLs)\par\par
\b Commands (PowerShell, from the project folder)\b0\par
1. .\\.venv\\Scripts\\python.exe main.py --search-company-careers\par
2. .\\.venv\\Scripts\\python.exe scripts\\retry_company_careers_errors.py (optional retry of failed URLs)\par
3. .\\.venv\\Scripts\\python.exe scripts\\export_company_careers_json.py\par\par
\b Outputs\b0\par
data\\reports\\company_careers_jobs.xlsx contains readable descriptions, composite scores, matched/missing skills, company totals, and unresolved URLs.\par
data\\reports\\company_careers_matches_over_70.json contains jobs scoring strictly above 70% and unresolved URL details.\par\par
Scores are candidate-specific and use config\\profile.yaml and config\\job_preferences.yaml; job descriptions and skill requirements are the reusable source data. Unreadable descriptions are recorded as errors and are not scored.\par
}
